### Farmer Routes - Ruraliza API
### Requer REST Client (VSCode) ou similar. Rode `npm start` antes de testar.
### Dados de seed: farmer id=1, farms id=1 (São José) e id=2 (Boa Vista).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@farmerId = 1
@farmId = 1
@serviceId = 1
@applicationId = 1

### --- SESSÃO ---
### Rode as duas primeiras: as demais usam o token (Authorization: Bearer).

### Entrar (seed: senha ruraliza123)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "produtor@exemplo.com",
  "password": "ruraliza123"
}

### Entrar como administrador (só para a lista de perfis)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/system/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@exemplo.com",
  "password": "ruraliza123"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### --- PRODUTORES ---

### Listar produtores
GET {{baseUrl}}/farmers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cadastrar produtor
POST {{baseUrl}}/farmers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "novo.produtor@exemplo.com",
  "name": "Carlos Produtor",
  "phone": "24977777777",
  "cpf": "93541134780",
  "password": "minhasenha123",
  "accept_terms": true
}

### Perfil do produtor
GET {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar produtor (id e cpf não podem ser alterados)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Produtor Atualizado",
  "phone": "24999990000"
}

### Editar produtor tentando alterar o cpf (deve retornar 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "12345678900"
}

### Remover produtor
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- SENHA E ACESSO ---
### Perfil de teste do seed: produtor@exemplo.com, senha ruraliza123.

### Entrar
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "farmer",
  "email": "produtor@exemplo.com",
  "password": "ruraliza123"
}

### Trocar a senha com a conta aberta (pede a senha atual)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "ruraliza123",
  "new_password": "novasenha123"
}

### Esqueci a senha, passo 1 (simulação: o token volta na resposta em vez de ir por e-mail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "farmer",
  "email": "produtor@exemplo.com"
}

### Esqueci a senha, passo 2 (cole o reset_token do passo 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/password-reset/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "COLE_O_RESET_TOKEN_AQUI",
  "password": "ruraliza123"
}

### --- FAZENDAS ---

### Listar fazendas do produtor
GET {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}/farms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cadastrar fazenda para o produtor
POST {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}/farms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Sítio Alegre, s/n",
  "city": "Vassouras",
  "state": "RJ",
  "latitude": -22.4036,
  "longitude": -43.6627
}

### Editar fazenda
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}/farms/{{farmId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "Estrada São José, Km 4",
  "latitude": -22.1201,
  "longitude": -43.2150
}

### Remover fazenda (409 se tiver serviço Pending/In Progress)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}/farms/{{farmId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- SERVIÇOS ---

### Solicitar novo serviço (RF01)
POST {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmer_id": {{farmerId}},
  "farm_id": {{farmId}},
  "name": "Colheita de milho",
  "category": "Colheita",
  "duration": 16,
  "price": 900
}

### Listar serviços do produtor
GET {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar serviços do produtor filtrando por status
GET {{baseUrl}}/farmers/{{farmerId}}/services?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar serviço com a fazenda
GET {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar serviço (só enquanto Pending)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Colheita de milho (2 dias)",
  "duration": 20,
  "price": 1100
}

### Cancelar serviço (só enquanto Pending; recusa as candidaturas pendentes)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services/{{serviceId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar candidaturas do serviço
GET {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services/{{serviceId}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aceitar candidatura (RF03)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services/{{serviceId}}/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "application_id": {{applicationId}},
  "action": "Accept"
}

### Recusar candidatura (RF03)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services/{{serviceId}}/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "application_id": {{applicationId}},
  "action": "Reject"
}

### Liberar pagamento (RF04)
POST {{baseUrl}}/farmers/services/{{serviceId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
